"memory": "Round 1: I own pipeline.js. Interface: processText(text) -> {text, tokens, count, unique, frequencies}. Must call injected tokenize(text). Handle prototype names (constructor, etc.) by using Object.create(null) for frequencies and unique set. text = tokens.join(' '). tokens = tokenize result. count = tokens.length. unique = first-seen distinct tokens in order. frequencies = counts per token. No shadowing of normalize/tokenize. No extra functions exported. Keep faithful.",
